{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "One-Time Setup" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "One-Time Setup"
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "إعداد لمرة واحدة"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This pairing is only required once. When you click 'Start Translation' in GameTranslator, the stream connects automatically; clicking 'Stop Translation' disconnects automatically." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This pairing is only required once. When you click 'Start Translation' in GameTranslator, the stream connects automatically; clicking 'Stop Translation' disconnects automatically."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "هذا الاقتران مطلوب مرة واحدة فقط. عند النقر على «ابدأ الترجمة» في GameTranslator يتصل البث تلقائيًا، وعند النقر على «أوقف الترجمة» ينقطع تلقائيًا."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ was damaged while downloading. Try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ was damaged while downloading. Try again."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تلف %@ أثناء التنزيل. حاول مرة أخرى."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. Create a free account at webostv.developer.lge.com." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Create a free account at webostv.developer.lge.com."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. أنشئ حسابًا مجانيًا على webostv.developer.lge.com."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. On the TV, open Apps." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. On the TV, open Apps."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. على التلفزيون، افتح شاشة التطبيقات (Apps)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. On the TV, open Settings › Device Preferences › About (Google TV: Settings › System › About)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. On the TV, open Settings › Device Preferences › About (Google TV: Settings › System › About)."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. على التلفزيون، افتح Settings › Device Preferences › About (في Google TV: Settings › System › About)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. On the TV, install Developer Mode from the LG Content Store and sign in." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. On the TV, install Developer Mode from the LG Content Store and sign in."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. على التلفزيون، ثبّت تطبيق Developer Mode من LG Content Store وسجّل الدخول."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. Press 1 2 3 4 5 on the remote (or type 12345 on the on-screen keypad). The Developer Mode window opens." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. Press 1 2 3 4 5 on the remote (or type 12345 on the on-screen keypad). The Developer Mode window opens."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. اضغط الأزرار 1 2 3 4 5 في ريموت التلفزيون (أو اكتب 12345 بلوحة المفاتيح على الشاشة). ستُفتح نافذة وضع المطوّر."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. Press OK on Build 7 times until it says you are a developer." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. Press OK on Build 7 times until it says you are a developer."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. اضغط OK على Build 7 مرات حتى تظهر رسالة بأنك أصبحت مطوّرًا."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. Go back to Device Preferences (Google TV: System) › Developer options and turn on USB debugging. Turn on Network debugging too if you see it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. Go back to Device Preferences (Google TV: System) › Developer options and turn on USB debugging. Turn on Network debugging too if you see it."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. ارجع إلى Device Preferences (في Google TV: System) › Developer options وفعّل USB debugging. فعّل Network debugging أيضًا إن وُجد."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. Turn Developer mode On, type this computer's address as Host PC IP: %@ and press OK." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. Turn Developer mode On, type this computer's address as Host PC IP: %@ and press OK."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. اجعل Developer mode على On، واكتب عنوان هذا الكمبيوتر في Host PC IP: %@ ثم اضغط OK."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. Turn on Dev Mode Status. The TV restarts and this screen continues by itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. Turn on Dev Mode Status. The TV restarts and this screen continues by itself."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. فعّل Dev Mode Status. سيُعاد تشغيل التلفزيون وتتابع هذه الشاشة من تلقاء نفسها."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "4. Restart the TV. This screen continues by itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "4. Restart the TV. This screen continues by itself."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "4. أعد تشغيل التلفزيون. ستتابع هذه الشاشة من تلقاء نفسها."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "8-digit code" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "8-digit code"
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "رمز من 8 أرقام"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A PS5 on the same Wi-Fi network as this Mac" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A PS5 on the same Wi-Fi network as this Mac"
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "جهاز PS5 على شبكة Wi-Fi نفسها مع جهاز Mac هذا"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A PS5 on the same network as this computer" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
