            "value" : "تطبيق GameTranslator للتلفزيون"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GameTranslator extends Developer Mode by itself each time you use it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "GameTranslator extends Developer Mode by itself each time you use it."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يمدّد GameTranslator مدة وضع المطوّر تلقائيًا في كل مرة تستخدمه."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GameTranslator is not affiliated with Sony Interactive Entertainment. PlayStation and PS5 are trademarks of Sony Interactive Entertainment Inc." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "GameTranslator is not affiliated with Sony Interactive Entertainment. PlayStation and PS5 are trademarks of Sony Interactive Entertainment Inc."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لا يتبع GameTranslator شركة Sony Interactive Entertainment. والاسمان PlayStation وPS5 علامتان تجاريتان لشركة Sony Interactive Entertainment Inc."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GameTranslator reads the English subtitles of your PS5 games and shows an Arabic translation on your TV, on top of the game. You keep playing on the TV with your own controller." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "GameTranslator reads the English subtitles of your PS5 games and shows an Arabic translation on your TV, on top of the game. You keep playing on the TV with your own controller."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يقرأ GameTranslator الترجمة النصية الإنجليزية في ألعاب PS5 ويعرض ترجمتها العربية على التلفزيون فوق اللعبة. وتواصل أنت اللعب على التلفزيون بذراع التحكم الخاص بك."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GameTranslator translates online with Google Translate, or with DeepL if you add your own key in Settings. There is nothing to download." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "GameTranslator translates online with Google Translate, or with DeepL if you add your own key in Settings. There is nothing to download."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يترجم GameTranslator عبر الإنترنت باستخدام Google Translate، أو باستخدام DeepL إذا أضفت مفتاحك الخاص في الإعدادات. لا حاجة إلى تنزيل أي شيء."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GameTranslator watches the game through Remote Play. If it used your own account, the PS5 would turn off your controller. With a second account you keep playing undisturbed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "GameTranslator watches the game through Remote Play. If it used your own account, the PS5 would turn off your controller. With a second account you keep playing undisturbed."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يشاهد GameTranslator اللعبة عبر Remote Play. لو استخدم حسابك لأوقف PS5 ذراع التحكم الخاص بك. بحساب ثانٍ تواصل اللعب دون انقطاع."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GameTranslator will send a sample subtitle to your TV. It should appear at the bottom of the screen, on top of the game." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "GameTranslator will send a sample subtitle to your TV. It should appear at the bottom of the screen, on top of the game."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
