    "If Windows asks whether GameTranslator may use the network, allow it for private networks." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If Windows asks whether GameTranslator may use the network, allow it for private networks."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "إذا سأل Windows عمّا إذا كان يُسمح لـ GameTranslator باستخدام الشبكة، فاسمح بذلك للشبكات الخاصة."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you don't see it, make sure the GameTranslator TV app is open and connect the TV again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you don't see it, make sure the GameTranslator TV app is open and connect the TV again."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "إن لم تظهر لك، فتأكد أن تطبيق GameTranslator للتلفزيون مفتوح ثم وصّل التلفزيون من جديد."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In fixed position you can also move subtitles with the ▲ and ▼ buttons on the TV remote." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In fixed position you can also move subtitles with the ▲ and ▼ buttons on the TV remote."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "في الموضع الثابت يمكنك أيضًا تحريك الترجمة النصية بزرّي ▲ و▼ في ريموت التلفزيون."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In the game's audio settings, turn the dialogue (voice) volume down; keep music and effects. If the game can show speaker names in subtitles, turn them on: every character then speaks with its own voice." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In the game's audio settings, turn the dialogue (voice) volume down; keep music and effects. If the game can show speaker names in subtitles, turn them on: every character then speaks with its own voice."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "في إعدادات الصوت داخل اللعبة، اخفض صوت الحوار (الأصوات) وأبقِ الموسيقى والمؤثرات. إذا كانت اللعبة تستطيع عرض اسم المتحدث في الترجمة النصية ففعّل ذلك: عندها تتكلم كل شخصية بصوتها الخاص."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install on the TV" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Install on the TV"
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ثبّت على التلفزيون"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install the GameTranslator TV app on this TV using the guide and open it. It finds this computer by itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Install the GameTranslator TV app on this TV using the guide and open it. It finds this computer by itself."
