    },
    "The PS5 Remote Play service stopped unexpectedly. Restart the PS5 and enter a new code." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The PS5 Remote Play service stopped unexpectedly. Restart the PS5 and enter a new code."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "توقفت خدمة Remote Play في PS5 على نحو غير متوقع. أعد تشغيل PS5 وأدخل رمزًا جديدًا."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The PS5 did not answer. Make sure it is on (not in rest mode), on the same network as this computer, and that Remote Play is turned on, then try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The PS5 did not answer. Make sure it is on (not in rest mode), on the same network as this computer, and that Remote Play is turned on, then try again."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لم يستجب PS5. تأكد أنه يعمل (وليس في وضع الراحة)، وأنه على الشبكة نفسها مع هذا الكمبيوتر، وأن Remote Play مفعّل، ثم حاول مرة أخرى."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The PS5 did not recognise this account. Get the code from the PS5 user signed in with the account you used in GameTranslator, or sign in again with that user's account." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The PS5 did not recognise this account. Get the code from the PS5 user signed in with the account you used in GameTranslator, or sign in again with that user's account."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لم يتعرّف PS5 على هذا الحساب. احصل على الرمز من مستخدم PS5 المسجّل دخوله بالحساب الذي استخدمته في GameTranslator، أو سجّل الدخول من جديد بحساب ذلك المستخدم."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The PS5 refused the code. Open Pair Device again on the PS5 and enter the new code." : {
      "localizations" : {
